  <ferc:NameOfOfficerWithCustodyOfCorporateBooks id="f-1" contextRef="c-1">David Slack</ferc:NameOfOfficerWithCustodyOfCorporateBooks>
  <ferc:TitleOfOfficerWithCustodyOfCorporateBooks id="f-2" contextRef="c-1">Chief Accounting Officer</ferc:TitleOfOfficerWithCustodyOfCorporateBooks>
  <ferc:AddressWhereCorporateBooksAreKept id="f-3" contextRef="c-1">845 Texas Avenue, Suite 1250, Houston, TX 77002</ferc:AddressWhereCorporateBooksAreKept>
  <ferc:StateOfIncorporation id="f-4" contextRef="c-1">DE</ferc:StateOfIncorporation>
  <ferc:IncorporationDate id="f-5" contextRef="c-1">2004-12-27</ferc:IncorporationDate>
  <ferc:SpecialLawRespondentIncorporatedUnder id="f-6" contextRef="c-1">No, not incorporated under special law. Cheniere Creole Trail Pipeline Company ("CTPL") was originally organized as a Delaware corporation on December 27, 2004. On March 31,2006 CTPL filed a Certificate of Conversion in the State of Delaware, converting it to Cheniere Creole Trail Pipeline, LP. Additionally, Cheniere Creole Trail Pipeline, LP filed a Certificate of Limited Partnership in the State of Delaware.</ferc:SpecialLawRespondentIncorporatedUnder>
  <ferc:IncorporatedUnderSpecialLawFlag id="f-7" contextRef="c-1">false</ferc:IncorporatedUnderSpecialLawFlag>
  <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutPropertyOfTheRespondentHeldByReceiverOrTrusteeDescription id="f-8" contextRef="c-1">NA</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutPropertyOfTheRespondentHeldByReceiverOrTrusteeDescription>
  <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered id="f-9" contextRef="c-1">During the year, respondent owned and, through associated company relationships, operated a natural gas pipeline system and engaged in the transportation of natural gas in Louisiana.</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered>
  <ferc:GeneralInformationChangeInAuditorFlag id="f-10" contextRef="c-1">false</ferc:GeneralInformationChangeInAuditorFlag>
  <ferc:EngagementDateOfIndependentAuditor id="f-11" contextRef="c-1" xsi:nil="true"></ferc:EngagementDateOfIndependentAuditor>
