        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Cheniere Creole Trail Pipeline, L.P. ("CTPL") does not issue it&#8217;s own debt and does not have a stand-alone bond rating. CTP is utilizing the average debt ratio of 56.24% and and equity ratio of 43.76% based the proxy group capital structures in calculation of its computation of AFUDC rates due to the use of CTPL&#8217;s parent, Cheniere Energy Partners, L.P. ("CQP"), capital structure would result in debt and equity ratios outside the range of capital structures of the proxy companies.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-26" id="fn-26" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The cost of rate for long term debt utilized in the computation of AFUDC is the interest rate on borrowed funds of our parent, CQP&#8217;s, long term debt.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-27" id="fn-27" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The cost rate for common equity utilized in the computation of AFUDC is the rate granted in Docket No. CP05-360-000.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-28" id="fn-28" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The Fixed Asset Method is used to report encroachments upon system gas.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-29" id="fn-29" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Balance includes $4,433,342 of account 101.1 land and building right of use lease assets.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-30" id="fn-30" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Balance includes $4,340,167 of account 101.1 land and building right of use lease assets.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-31" id="fn-31" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Balance includes $82,956 of account 101.1 equipment right of use lease assets.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-32" id="fn-32" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Balance includes $60,044 of account 101.1 equipment right of use lease assets.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-33" id="fn-33" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%">
          <tr>
            <td style="width:1.0%"/>
            <td style="width:98.900%"/>
            <td style="width:0.1%"/>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td colspan="3" style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;border-left:1pt solid #000;border-right:1pt solid #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom">
              <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Schedule Page: 262 Line No.: 2 Column: a</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">CTPL does not have employees and relies on various services agreements with associated companies in the ordinary course of business, including services required to construct, operate and maintain the pipeline and administrative services. Affiliate costs are reflected, as appropriate, within the payroll tax expenses. Footnote applies to lines 2 and 14.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-34" id="fn-34" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Sales/Use tax incurred during the year charged to FERC Accounts 107 CWIP, 101 Utility Plant, 154 Plant Materials and Operating Supplies, 401 Operations Expense, and/or 402 Maintenance Expense.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-35" id="fn-35" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Section 6.15 of the General Terms and Conditions of Creole Trail&#8217;s FERC Gas Tariff, First Revised Volume No. 1</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-36" id="fn-36" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Volumes noted represent shipper contract volumes. Actual allocated deliveries were 492,868,762 Dth.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-37" id="fn-37" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The depreciation plant basis reflects a balance as of 12/31/2025</span>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-38" id="fn-38" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The depreciation plant basis reflects a balance as of 12/31/2025</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-39" id="fn-39" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Transmission Plant excludes non-depreciable land. Remaining assets reflect the FERC Approved depreciation rate of 2.50%.</span>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-40" id="fn-40" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The depreciation rates for General Plant assets range from 20% to 33%</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-41" id="fn-41" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The depreciation rates for Intangible Plant assets range from 2.5% to 33%</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-42" id="fn-42" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:19pt">
        <table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%">
          <tr>
            <td style="width:1.0%"/>
            <td style="width:98.900%"/>
            <td style="width:0.1%"/>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td colspan="3" style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;border-left:1pt solid #000;border-right:1pt solid #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom">
              <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Schedule Page: 352 Line No.: 40 Column: b</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">CTPL does not have employees and relies on various services agreements with associated companies in the ordinary course of business, including services required to construct, operate and maintain the pipeline and administrative services. Affiliate costs are reflected, as appropriate, within Account 926, Employee Pensions and Benefits.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-43" id="fn-43" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:19pt">
        <table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%">
          <tr>
            <td style="width:1.0%"/>
            <td style="width:98.900%"/>
            <td style="width:0.1%"/>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td colspan="3" style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;border-left:1pt solid #000;border-right:1pt solid #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom">
              <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Schedule Page: 354 Line No.: 75 Column: c</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">Includes salaries and wages charges to Other Preliminary Survey and Investigation charges (183.2).</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-44" id="fn-44" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Creole Trail Pipeline, L.P. owns and operates approximately 94 miles of mainline pipeline and 0.8 miles of the Texas Eastern Transmission Corporation (TETCO) lateral pipeline for a total of 94.8 certificated transmission miles of pipeline.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-45" id="fn-45" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Other Receipts includes Linepack Receipts (referenced on Line No. 40 and/or Line No.53 in Schedule 521).</span>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-46" id="fn-46" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Other Receipts includes Linepack Receipts (referenced on Line No. 40 and/or Line No.53 in Schedule 521).</span>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-47" id="fn-47" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Other Deliveries includes Linepack and miscellaneous loss due to blowdowns (referenced on Line No. 40 and/or Line No.53 in Schedule 521).</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-48" id="fn-48" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Other Deliveries includes Linepack and miscellaneous loss due to blowdowns (referenced on Line No. 40 and/or Line No.53 in Schedule 521).</span>
    </link:footnote>
